<title>BRUNEI: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>BRUNEI GOVERNMENT LIST (970226)</p>
<p>			   (Formed 21 October 1986)</p>
<p>  Head of State......Sultan Sir HASSANAL Bolkiah</p>
<p>(also Prime Minister, Defence &amp; Finance Ministers)</p>
<p>CABINET</p>
<p>  Prime Minister...............See Head of State</p>
